 "summary": "The coefficient reflections hide their bodies and have a complete API: `(rfl)` `_def` lemmas, simp evaluation lemmas above, below and on the axis, `_zero` lemmas for the derivative and zeroth-order reflections, and two-way local L\u1d56 iff lemmas for all three. The general lemmas are public in their proper files, the module move leaves no forwarding module (no importer of the old path remains), and the only private helper `reflectTest` is a proof-local composition of existing public test-function operations.",
